{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"id":"Stack-Cairn.K-brain","latestVersion":"0.107.32","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"基于 Go 构建、运行在终端里的编程 Agent。","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"文档","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/Stack-Cairn/K-brain/blob/main/README.zh-CN.md"}],"installationNotes":"在终端中运行 kn。首次使用前，请在 %USERPROFILE%\\.k-brain\\config.json 中配置模型提供商。","license":"Apache-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/Stack-Cairn/K-brain/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"zh-CN","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"A terminal coding agent built in Go.","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"Documentation","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/Stack-Cairn/K-brain/blob/HEAD/README.md"}],"installationNotes":"Before first use, configure model providers in %USERPROFILE%\\.k-brain\\config.json.","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"K-brain is a terminal coding agent built in Go, with a reusable backend for other frontends. It reads code, edits files, runs commands, and verifies results in one session. The main binary is kn, short for Ke Nao.","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","chatbot","code","coding","large-language-model","llm","programming"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"基于 Go 构建、运行在终端里的编程 Agent。","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"文档","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/Stack-Cairn/K-brain/blob/main/README.zh-CN.md"}],"installationNotes":"在终端中运行 kn。首次使用前，请在 %USERPROFILE%\\.k-brain\\config.json 中配置模型提供商。","license":"Apache-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/Stack-Cairn/K-brain/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"氪脑（K-brain）是运行在终端里的编程 Agent，用 Go 构建，也可作为其他前端的后端底座。读代码、改文件、执行命令、验证结果，在同一会话中完成任务。运行 kn 开始使用，取自“氪脑”拼音 Ke Nao。","name":"K-brain","packageUrl":"https://github.com/Stack-Cairn/K-brain","publisher":"Stack-Cairn","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/Stack-Cairn/K-brain/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/Stack-Cairn","releaseNotes":"K-brain v0.107.32\n本版从 main 的 72552d7 构建，在 v0.107.31 的基础上为 kn 终端界面新增 /skills 命令。\nkn 界面（#202）\n- 新增 